gruvoc convert: Convert mesh from one format to another

USAGE

    $ gruvoc convert [I [O]] [OPTIONS]

ARGUMENTS

    I: Name of input file
    O: Name of output file

OPTIONS

    --help
        Print this help message and exit

    --add-cp
        Add pressure coefficient to surface state

    --add-mach
        Add Mach number to surface state

    --flow FLOWFILE
        Name of FUN3D .flow file from which to read state

    -i IFILE
        Name of input file

    --mapbc, --mapbcfile MAPBCFILE
        Use .mapbc file to name surface components

    --novol
        Delete volume cells before writing output mesh

    -o OFILE
        Name of output file

    --tavg TAVGFILE
        Name of FUN3D .tavg file from which to read state

    --verbose, -v
        Write more verbose status messages
